import SGA.SGA2.ExposeVII.HomDetection

/-!
# SGA 2, Exposé VII: vanishing criteria and coherence

VII.1.3 is proved on locally noetherian schemes for the actual internal Hom
sheaf, literal stalk supports, a coherent source and an arbitrary quasi-coherent
target. The affine reduction uses genuine restricted modules and the canonical
affine coefficient presentations. The more general formulation of VII.1.3
without local noetherianity and the other vanishing and coherence results
remain to be formalized.
-/
